{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0132-s002", "text": "Ibland måste den sökande utföra förhandsuppgifter utöver inträdesprovet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0132-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.341705322265625, "generation_seconds": 13.492741130059585, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0132-s003", "text": "Om en studerande vill avlägga högskolestudier på finska eller svenska, måste hen ha tillräckliga kunskaper i dessa språk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0132-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.588299319727891, "peak": 0.2933349609375, "generation_seconds": 18.84540831297636, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0132-s004", "text": "Många examina kan avläggas också på engelska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0132-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.280517578125, "generation_seconds": 6.623369749868289, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0132-s005", "text": "I sådana fall ska den studerande visa att hen har tillräckliga kunskaper i engelska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0132-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.290771484375, "generation_seconds": 11.686648838920519, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0133-s001", "text": "Yrkeshögskolestudier omfattar arbetspraktik och ett examensarbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0133-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.355682373046875, "generation_seconds": 9.539320399053395, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0133-s002", "text": "I examensarbetet sätter sig den studerande grundligt in i ett specialområde och visar att hen kan tillämpa sina kunskaper.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0133-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.45245361328125, "generation_seconds": 15.557818962959573, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0134-s001", "text": "Inom vissa områden kan man också studera till en högre yrkeshögskoleexamen (högre YH), vilket tar ett till ett och ett halvt år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0134-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.30511474609375, "generation_seconds": 15.266417931066826, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0134-s002", "text": "En högre yrkeshögskoleexamen är en examen på magisternivå avsedd för personer som redan är i arbetslivet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-hogskolor/narration/resume-20261103T015730431635+0000-3/hb-c08-u0134-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.255767822265625, "generation_seconds": 14.125799733912572, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
